    "The mill's new waterwheel, funded by Duke Aldric, was completed after the old one collapsed in spring floods.",
    "A traveling merchant from the capital brought news that King Eldric has declared a royal hunt in the Northmarch for next spring."
  ],
  "texture_line": "The scent of fresh-cut timber from the mill's repairs mingles with the river's damp breath, and the inn buzzes with talk of the coming hunt."
}

